# Copy to docker/crontab (gitignored: lane ids describe your taste) and list your lanes.
# One line runs the lanes in order, each starting when the one before ends; each posts its own report.
# An expired login or a Spotify block stops the rest (one line says which were left out).
# Times are in the container's TZ (docker/.env).
0 9 * * *  node /app/dist/main.js lane-a lane-b
